{"seq":8,"slug":"indie-product-analytics","title":"独立产品的数据分析","stage":"DONE","category":"indie-app-shipping","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/indie-product-analytics","rating":{"composite":3.69,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 独立产品的数据分析 简介\n\n要用数据改进产品，独立开发者需要的不是复杂的分析体系，而是少数对的、能驱动决策的指标，加上对小样本数据的清醒认识。本 hub 面向想用数据做好产品决策的独立开发者，从分析工具栈（隐私友好的分析、该测量什么、避免过度埋点）讲起，覆盖事件埋点（事件分类法、漏斗测量、把埋点做好）、重要的指标（北极星与漏斗、收入指标、虚荣 vs 可行动），以及从数据做决策（小样本下的决策、量化加质化、数据知情而非数据驱动）。它聚焦分析/测量的手艺与小团队的决策方式，与「留存」hub 的留存指标互补。贯穿全篇的实操主线是：测量服务于决策而非越多越好、用隐私友好工具和数据最小化、盯可行动指标避免虚荣与虚假精确、用质化补充小样本量化——并以「数据知情而非数据驱动」的成熟态度，让数据增强而非取代判断与愿景。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"analytics-stack","title":"Analytics Stack","docCount":3,"url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/indie-product-analytics/analytics-stack","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"privacy-friendly-analytics","title":"隐私友好的分析","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/indie-product-analytics/analytics-stack/privacy-friendly-analytics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"what-to-measure","title":"该测量什么","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/indie-product-analytics/analytics-stack/what-to-measure"},{"seq":3,"slug":"avoid-over-instrumenting","title":"避免过度埋点","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/indie-product-analytics/analytics-stack/avoid-over-instrumenting"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"event-instrumentation","title":"Event Instrumentation","docCount":3,"url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/indie-product-analytics/event-instrumentation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"event-taxonomy","title":"事件分类法","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/indie-product-analytics/event-instrumentation/event-taxonomy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"funnel-measurement","title":"漏斗测量","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/indie-product-analytics/event-instrumentation/funnel-measurement"},{"seq":3,"slug":"instrumenting-well","title":"把埋点做好","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/indie-product-analytics/event-instrumentation/instrumenting-well"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"metrics-that-matter","title":"Metrics That Matter","docCount":3,"url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/indie-product-analytics/metrics-that-matter","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"north-star-and-funnel","title":"北极星与漏斗指标","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/indie-product-analytics/metrics-that-matter/north-star-and-funnel"},{"seq":2,"slug":"revenue-metrics","title":"收入指标","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/indie-product-analytics/metrics-that-matter/revenue-metrics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"vanity-vs-actionable","title":"虚荣指标与可行动指标","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/indie-product-analytics/metrics-that-matter/vanity-vs-actionable"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"deciding-from-data","title":"Deciding From Data","docCount":3,"url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/indie-product-analytics/deciding-from-data","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"small-sample-decisions","title":"小样本下的决策","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/indie-product-analytics/deciding-from-data/small-sample-decisions"},{"seq":2,"slug":"quant-plus-qual","title":"量化加质化","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/indie-product-analytics/deciding-from-data/quant-plus-qual"},{"seq":3,"slug":"data-informed-not-data-driven","title":"数据知情，而非数据驱动","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/indie-product-analytics/deciding-from-data/data-informed-not-data-driven"}]}]}